<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Scintilla</title>
<meta name="description" content="A BEAM-powered lambda runtime: warm processes, twelve runtimes, durable workflows.">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'; worker-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://scintilla-run.github.io/">
<style is:global>
  :root { --accent: #d97706; --bg: #fafaf9; --fg: #1c1917; --muted: #57534e; --card: #ffffff; --border: #e7e5e4; color-scheme: light dark; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root { --bg: #0c0a09; --fg: #fafaf9; --muted: #a8a29e; --card: #1c1917; --border: #292524; }
  }
  * { margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font: 16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
  main { max-width: 60rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
  .latin { color: var(--accent); font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 3.6rem); line-height: 1.1; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; }
  .tagline { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 44rem; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin: 3rem 0; }
  .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem; }
  .card h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
  .card p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .rule { height: 3px; width: 4rem; background: var(--accent); border-radius: 2px; margin: 1.5rem 0 0; }
  footer { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; } a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <div class="latin">scintilla — a spark; the smallest possible amount</div>
  <h1>Scintilla</h1>
  <p class="tagline">A BEAM-powered lambda runtime: warm processes, twelve runtimes, durable workflows.</p>
  <div class="rule"></div>
  <div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Warm lambda invocation</h3><p>Reusable child processes answer invocations without cold starts, managed by BEAM supervision.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Twelve runtimes</h3><p>Node.js, Python, Ruby, Bash, Go, Dart, Erlang, Elixir, Java, Gleam, Rust, and browser automation.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Durable workflows</h3><p>Start runs, deliver signals, cancel, and replay step history over plain HTTP.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Browser functions</h3><p>Playwright and Puppeteer lambdas in a dedicated containerized browser runtime.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>HTTP and NATS</h3><p>Invoke over REST or NATS subjects with queue groups and result publishing.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Fail-closed auth</h3><p>Invocation endpoints refuse to run without a configured shared secret.</p></div>
  </div>
  <footer>
    <a href="https://github.com/scintilla-run">GitHub org</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/scintilla-run/gleam-lambda-runner">Server repository</a>
    <span>© 2026 Scintilla</span>
  </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
